{"id":"f48430418e7cee0b","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-model10-external-subset.md","title":"ZFC Model10 External Subset","display":"df-zfc-model10-external-subset — ZFC Model10 External Subset","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-model10-external-subset","aliases":["58-df-zfc-model10-external-subset"],"display":"df-zfc-model10-external-subset — ZFC Model10 External Subset","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-model]]","[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-model10-external-subset"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-model10-external-subset</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-model10-external-subset — ZFC Model10 External Subset"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"923884eb8fe4e61d\" href=\"?note=923884eb8fe4e61d\" title=\"58-df-model\">58-df-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,\\mathcal M,T,\\mathcal L\\in V\">\\(A,\\mathcal M,T,\\mathcal L\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Model}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Model}_S\\)</span> is the three-place predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"923884eb8fe4e61d\" href=\"?note=923884eb8fe4e61d\" title=\"58-df-model\">58-df-model</a> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\)</span> is the universe from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel10ExternalSubset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel10ExternalSubset}_S\\)</span> is the four-place predicate defined below</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model10\\text{-}external\\text{-}subset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel10ExternalSubset}_S(A,\\mathcal M,T,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Model}_S(\\mathcal M,T,\\mathcal L)\\land A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\land A\\notin\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model10\\text{-}external\\text{-}subset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel10ExternalSubset}_S(A,\\mathcal M,T,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Model}_S(\\mathcal M,T,\\mathcal L)\\land A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\land A\\notin\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>“外部”是相对于给定模型而言：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的元素都来自模型论域，但 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 本身不是该论域中的集合。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"923884eb8fe4e61d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","locat